PUT http://localhost:3000/api/milk-changes/mc-1/assign-route
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "handlerId": "staff-clerk-1",
  "newRouteId": "route-2",
  "newRouteName": "城东B线",
  "routeAdjustReason": "优化配送路线，从A线调整到B线",
  "remark": "首次调整路线，验证历史记录生成"
}

### 29. 查看 mc-1 路线调整历史
### ========================================
GET http://localhost:3000/api/milk-changes/mc-1/route-histories

### 30. 查看 mc-1 完整回看
### ========================================
GET http://localhost:3000/api/milk-changes/mc-1/review

