### 38. 验证首次路线调整：assign-route 旧路线从客户补齐
### （先创建一个新的订奶变更，无路线变更记录）
### ========================================
POST http://localhost:3000/api/milk-changes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "cust-1",
  "changeType": "change_address",
  "changeDetail": "测试首次路线调整",
  "oldAddress": "城东区阳光花园1栋302室",
  "newAddress": "城东区阳光花园5栋601室",
  "assignedToId": "staff-clerk-1",
  "remark": "用于测试首次路线调整旧路线不为空"
}

### 39. 拿到上面创建的记录的ID后，执行 assign-route
### （请把 mc-new-1 替换成实际返回的ID）
### ========================================
# PUT http://localhost:3000/api/milk-changes/mc-new-1/assign-route
# Content-Type: application/json
#
# {
#   "handlerId": "staff-clerk-1",
#   "newRouteId": "route-2",
#   "newRouteName": "城东B线",
#   "routeAdjustReason": "测试首次调整，验证oldRoute从客户补齐",
#   "remark": "首次调整路线"
# }

### 40. 然后查看 route-histories，验证首次调整也落了历史记录
### （请把 mc-new-1 替换成实际返回的ID）
### ========================================
# GET http://localhost:3000/api/milk-changes/mc-new-1/route-histories

### ========================================
### 【最新修复验证】404 和路线校验
### ========================================

### 41. 验证 404：查询不存在的订奶变更
### 预期：HTTP 404，code=60001
### ========================================
GET http://localhost:3000/api/milk-changes/not-exist-001

### 42. 验证 404：使用不存在的员工ID处理
### 预期：HTTP 404，code=61002
### ========================================
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/milk-changes/mc-3/process
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "handlerId": "staff-not-exist",
  "targetStatus": "clerk_processing"
}

### 43. 验证 404：创建订奶变更使用不存在的客户ID
### 预期：HTTP 404，code=61001
### ========================================
POST http://localhost:3000/api/milk-changes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "cust-not-exist",
  "changeType": "add_product",
  "changeDetail": "测试"
}

### 44. 验证路线校验：process 使用不存在的 routeId
### 预期：HTTP 404，code=61003，不写入伪造路线名称
### ========================================
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/milk-changes/mc-3/process
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "handlerId": "staff-clerk-1",
  "targetStatus": "clerk_processing",
  "newRouteId": "route-fake-999",
  "newRouteName": "我伪造的路线名称",
  "routeAdjustReason": "测试路线校验"
}

### 45. 验证路线校验：assign-route 使用不存在的 routeId
### 预期：HTTP 404，code=61003，不写入伪造路线名称
### ========================================
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/milk-changes/mc-3/assign-route
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "handlerId": "staff-clerk-1",
  "newRouteId": "route-fake-999",
  "newRouteName": "我伪造的路线名称"
}

### 46. 验证路线校验：即使 newRouteName 传错，也会回填标准名称
### 传入 newRouteName="随便写的名字"，实际应该回填成"城西线"
### ========================================
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/milk-changes/mc-3/process
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "handlerId": "staff-clerk-1",
  "targetStatus": "clerk_processing",
  "newRouteId": "route-3",
  "newRouteName": "随便写的名字，应该会被覆盖",
  "routeAdjustReason": "测试回填标准路线名称"
}

### 47. 查看 mc-3 详情，验证 newRouteName 是标准的"城西线"而非伪造名称
### ========================================
GET http://localhost:3000/api/milk-changes/mc-3
